<title>USA: Table - Alabama Power Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>Table - Alabama Power Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net income	     $63,137		  $95,778</p>
<p>		     12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net income	    $323,495		 $375,577</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Alabama Power is a unit of Southern Co.</p>
<p>Total Energy Sales for the second quarter of 1997 were 15.0 billion kilowatt-hours, versus 16.0 billion kilowatt-hours a year ago.</p>
<p>Total Energy Sales for the 12-month period ended June 1997 were 64.0 billion kilowatt-hours, versus 65.2 billion kilowatt-hours for the 12-month period ended June 1996.</p>
